<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Premium Terazim Infrastructure Supplies</title>
    <!-- Modern Tailwind Styling & Icons -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-blue-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- Header / Navigation Bar -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="bg-slate-800 text-white p-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-xs">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-road text-xl text-blue-400"></i>
                </div>
                <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900">TERAZIM<span class="text-blue-600 font-medium">INFRA</span></span>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-10 font-semibold text-slate-600 text-sm tracking-wide">
                <a href="#features" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">ጥራትና ብቃት (Features)</a>
                <a href="#products" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">ምርቶቻችን (Products)</a>
                <a href="#gallery" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">የፕሮጀክት ጋለሪ (Gallery)</a>
                <a href="#order" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">ትዕዛዝ ማቅረቢያ (Order)</a>
            </nav>
            <div>
                <a href="#order" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-xs tracking-wide">
                    ዋጋ ይጠይቁ / Get Quote
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero / Introduction Section -->
    <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-950 to-blue-950 text-white py-28 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 bg-cover bg-center mix-blend-overlay" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534349762230-e0cac37a3e1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80');"></div>
        <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="max-w-3xl">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1.5 px-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 tracking-wider uppercase mb-6">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-[10px]"></i> Infrastructure Approved Standard
                </span>
                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
                    Heavy-Duty Grey Terazim for Modern Corridor Projects
                </h1>
                <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-blue-400 mb-4 leading-normal">
                    ለከባድ ጭነት እና ለመንገድ ኮሪደር ግንባታ የሚሆኑ የቴራዞ ምርቶች
                </p>
                <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                    Engineered precisely to withstand heavy pedestrian traffic and municipal demands. Beautifully integrated grey aggregate designs tailored for modern urban sidewalks and city road corridors.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                    <a href="#products" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 tracking-wide">
                        ምርቶችን ይመልከቱ / Explore Catalog
                    </a>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20 text-white text-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold transition-all backdrop-blur-xs tracking-wide">
                        የተጠናቀቁ ስራዎች / View Gallery
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section id="features" class="py-24 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl tracking-tight">ለምን እኛን ይመርጣሉ? (Core Strengths)</h2>
                <div class="h-1 w-16 bg-blue-600 mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
                <div class="p-8 bg-slate-50/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/60 transition-all hover:border-blue-500/40">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-xl font-bold"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">High Load Capacity (ከፍተኛ ጥንካሬ)</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">Industrial grade pressure-compressed tiles that guarantee maximum load-bearing limits. Built to prevent structural cracking under constant public footfall and light machinery.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-8 bg-slate-50/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/60 transition-all hover:border-blue-500/40">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-xl font-bold"><i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-showers-heavy"></i></div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Anti-Slip Texture (የማያንሸራትት)</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">Engineered with specialized micro-abrasive protective surfaces. Provides ultimate traction safety during heavy rainy seasons, removing structural slip liabilities.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-8 bg-slate-50/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/60 transition-all hover:border-blue-500/40">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-xl font-bold"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-ramp-box"></i></div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Mass Scale Supply (በከፍተኛ መጠን)</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">Equipped with highly optimized batching plants to sustain consistent delivery schedules for vast multi-kilometer city road corridor upgrades.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Clear Product Catalog Grid -->
    <section id="products" class="py-24 bg-slate-50 border-t border-b border-slate-200/60">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl tracking-tight">የምርት ማውጫ (Product Specification Matrix)</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600">Select standard government-approved variants matching specific contract code requirements.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Product Card 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs border border-slate-200 flex flex-col transition-all hover:shadow-md">
                    <div class="h-56 bg-slate-200 relative bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154526-990dced4db0d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80');">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/90 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold tracking-wide uppercase shadow-xs">Walkways</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Standard Corridor Terazim</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 mb-4">መደበኛ የኮሪደር ቴራዞ</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">Perfectly suited for open-air pedestrian avenues, wide city squares, and public plazas. Clean grey background with high-durability granite chips.</p>
                            
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
                                <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-slate-200/60">40×40 cm</span>
                                <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-slate-200/60">50×50 cm</span>
                                <span class="bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-blue-100">Thickness: 3-4 cm</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <a href="#order" class="block text-center w-full bg-slate-900 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm tracking-wide">እዘዝ / Select Product</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Product Card 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs border border-slate-200 flex flex-col transition-all hover:shadow-md">
                    <div class="h-56 bg-slate-200 relative bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598514982205-f36b96d1e8d4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80');">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold tracking-wide uppercase shadow-xs">Accessibility</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Tactile (Braille) Terazim</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 mb-4">ታክታይል (ለአይነ ስውራን መስመር)</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">Features raised standard guide dots and directional paths in a matching premium grey finish. Formulated for high safety visibility and code regulations.</p>
                            
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
                                <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-slate-200/60">30×30 cm</span>
                                <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-slate-200/60">40×40 cm</span>
                                <span class="bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-amber-100">Raised Profiles</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <a href="#order" class="block text-center w-full bg-slate-900 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm tracking-wide">እዘዝ / Select Product</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Product Card 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs border border-slate-200 flex flex-col transition-all hover:shadow-md">
                    <div class="h-56 bg-slate-200 relative bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515162305285-0293e4767cc2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80');">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/90 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold tracking-wide uppercase shadow-xs">Borders</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Heavy Reinforced Curbstones</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 mb-4">የመንገድ ዳርቻ ኬርብስተን</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">High-impact border blocks structurally cast in dark grey tones to divide motorized transit lanes from standard elevated walkways safely.</p>
                            
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
                                <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-slate-200/60">Custom Cut Lengths</span>
                                <span class="bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold border border-blue-100">Thickness: Up to 8 cm</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <a href="#order" class="block text-center w-full bg-slate-900 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm tracking-wide">እዘዝ / Select Product</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Project Gallery -->
    <section id="gallery" class="py-24 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl tracking-tight">የማምረቻ እና የተከላ እይታዎች (Corridor Installation Showcase)</h2>
                <div class="h-1 w-16 bg-blue-600 mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
                <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600">See our attractive grey terrazzo road tiles fully integrated within active modern sidewalk and transport frameworks.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 relative group h-80">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569336415962-a4bd9f69cd83?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Finished Walkway Corridor" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
                        <span class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Integrated Urban Walkway Pavement</span>
                        <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs">Installed seamlessly with curbs and drainage infrastructure.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-slate-200 relative group h-80">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589939705384-5185137a7f0f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Production Batching" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
                        <span class="text-white font-bold text-lg">High-Density Aggregate Matrix</span>
                        <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs">Exposed surface finish optimized for public safety in all weather conditions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Procurement Form -->
    <section id="order" class="py-24 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">የዋጋ መጠየቂያና ማዘዣ ቅጽ (RFQ Procurement Portal)</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-600">Fill in your basic project framework specs. Our logistics department will reply with custom volume assessments within 24 hours.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
                <form class="space-y-7">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Company / Project Framework Name</label>
                            <input type="text" placeholder="e.g., Highway Development Corp" class="w-full px-4 py-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:border-blue-600 transition-all outline-hidden text-sm">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Specific Site Location / Site ID</label>
                            <input type="text" placeholder="e.g., Corridor Route 2, Sector B" class="w-full px-4 py-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:border-blue-600 transition-all outline-hidden text-sm">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Target Product Selection</label>
                            <select class="w-full px-4 py-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:border-blue-600 transition-all outline-hidden text-sm text-slate-700">
                                <option>Standard Corridor Terazim (Grey Aggregate)</option>
                                <option>Tactile (Braille) Accessibility variant</option>
                                <option>Heavy Reinforced Curbstone profiles</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Estimated Volume Target (M²)</label>
                            <input type="number" placeholder="e.g., 2500" class="w-full px-4 py-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:border-blue-600 transition-all outline-hidden text-sm">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Primary Official Contact (Email / Phone)</label>
                        <input type="text" placeholder="e.g., info@yourfirm.com or +251..." class="w-full px-4 py-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:border-blue-600 transition-all outline-hidden text-sm">
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Custom Project Notes / Deadline Directives</label>
                        <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Mention color schemes, exact aggregate chip mixes, or urgent transport needs..." class="w-full px-4 py-3.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:border-blue-600 transition-all outline-hidden text-sm"></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-2">
                        <button type="button" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-4 px-6 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md shadow-blue-600/10 tracking-wide text-center text-sm">
                            ይላኩ / Submit Quote Request
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-500 py-12 border-t border-slate-900">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-white opacity-90">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-road text-blue-500 text-xl"></i>
                <span class="text-lg font-black tracking-tight">TERAZIM<span class="text-blue-500 font-medium">INFRA</span></span>
            </div>
            <p>&copy; 2026 TerazimInfra Manufacturing. All municipal engineering specifications verified.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
